Package: larkbox-fan
Version: 1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nikolai <lmnikolaev@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/lmnikolaev/larkbox-fan
Depends: systemd (>= 253)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: fan control for Chuwi LarkBox mini PC
 The Chuwi LarkBox BIOS only switches the fan when the ACPI temperature
 sensor SEN4 is read. Windows polls it through Intel DPTF, Linux does not,
 so the fan is randomly stuck on or off. This package installs a small
 systemd service that polls SEN4 every 5 seconds, restoring the Windows
 behaviour (fan on above 55 C, off below).
